                "statement": "Onward links from A-9895: only T0038, T0039 and T0040 link onward, all to T0041 (A-9895 to A-1415, 14000), which is not passed on. The longest chain has 1 onward link, and the route accounts are A-9895 and A-1415. T0035, T0036 and T0037 have no onward link, so under the run's rules their funds are recorded as stopping at A-9895. The terminal accounts are therefore A-1415 and A-9895. A-1415 does send T0055 (90000 to A-9514) later, but no onward link connects T0041 to T0055 (the gap is about 11,700,000 ms, above the 1,800,000 ms maximum).",
