              {
                "id": "F6",
                "statement": "Shared devices on the routes: for the A-9278 alert, device D-568 sent all six onward transfers (T0007, T0008, T0009, T0014, T0015, T0016) from three different route accounts: A-9278, A-5092 and A-2897. A-4989 sends nothing in the dataset. For the A-9895 alert, no device is shared among its route accounts: A-9895 sent from D-699 and A-1415 from D-785, and no other account used either device.",
